{"annotations": [{"id": "ko_006_0010_0010_0001", "offset": 1, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『荀子』의 가장 오래된 주석은 당대(唐代) 양경(楊倞)의 것으로(沈嘯寰, 王星賢 編, 1988, 『荀子集解』, 北京: 中華書局, 點校說明; 荀況 著, 王天海 編, 2005 『荀子校釋』 (中華要籍集釋叢書), 上海: 上海古籍出版社, 前言 참고), 원문의 본주(本注)는 양경의 주석을 따랐다. 역대 주석가들의 주석은 모두 王天海가 정리한 『荀子校釋』(荀況 著, 『荀子校釋』, 2005)을 참고하였다.", "type": "번역주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 29, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "楊倞注 : 干·越, 猶言吳·越. 『呂氏春秋』, 「荊有次非得寶劍於干·越」. 高誘曰：「吳邑也.」 貉, 東北夷. 同聲, 謂啼聲同. 貉, 莫革反.\"", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 29, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 19, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0010_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "干越", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "夷貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "干", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "越", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "吳", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "越", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "呂氏春秋", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "次非", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "干", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "越", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "高誘", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "吳", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東北夷", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0010_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第一 勸學篇 第一 › 干越·夷貉之子, 生而同聲, 長而異俗, 敎使之然也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0010_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 干越·夷貉之子, 生而同聲, 長而異俗, 敎使之然也.", "title": "干越·夷貉之子, 生而同聲, 長而異俗, 敎使之然也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 25, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 霍叔, 武王弟也. 出, 行也. 周居豐·鎬. 軍出三日, 未當至共. 蓋文王三分天下有其二, 境土已近於洛矣. 或曰：至汜之後三日也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 59, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "楊倞注 : 比干, 紂賢臣, 箕子, 紂諸父. 箕, 國名, 子爵也. 飛廉·惡來, 皆紂之嬖臣. 飛廉善走, 惡來有力也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 59, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 39, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0020_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "霍叔", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "霍叔", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "周", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "豐", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "鎬", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "文王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "洛", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "汜", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "周公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "飛廉", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "惡來", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "飛廉", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "惡來", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "飛廉", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "惡來", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0020_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第四 儒效篇 第八 › 霍叔懼曰：｢出三日而五災至, 無乃不可乎?", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0020_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 霍叔懼曰：｢出三日而五災至, 無乃不可乎?｣. 周公曰：｢刳比干而囚箕子, 飛廉·惡來知政. 夫又惡有不可焉?｣.", "title": "霍叔懼曰：｢出三日而五災至, 無乃不可乎?", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 19, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 夷俗, 謂蠻·夷之樂. 雅, 正聲也. 大師, 樂官之長. 大讀太.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 19, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 14, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0030_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "夷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "夷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "蠻", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "夷", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0030_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第五 王制篇 第九 › 使夷俗邪音不敢亂雅, 大師之事也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0030_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 使夷俗邪音不敢亂雅, 大師之事也.", "title": "使夷俗邪音不敢亂雅, 大師之事也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 45, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 伊尹諫太甲, 箕子諫紂.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 86, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 59, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0040_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "伊尹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "伊尹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "太甲", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "子胥", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "平原君", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "趙", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "信陵君", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "魏", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0040_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第九 臣道篇 第十三 › 故明君之所賞, 闇君之所罰也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0040_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 故明君之所賞, 闇君之所罰也. 闇君之所賞, 明君之所殺也. 伊尹·箕子, 可謂諫矣. 比干·子胥, 可謂爭矣. 平原君之於趙, 可謂輔矣. 信陵君之於魏, 可謂拂矣.", "title": "故明君之所賞, 闇君之所罰也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 31, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 『列女傳』曰：「炮烙, 爲膏銅柱加之炭上, 令有罪者行焉, 輒墮火中. 紂與妲己大笑.」 烙, 古責反.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 49, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "楊倞注 : 懍然, 悚栗之貌, 莫自謂必全其命也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 49, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 34, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0050_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "列女傳", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "妲己", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0050_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第十 議兵篇 第十五 › 其所以統之者非其道故也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0050_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 其所以統之者非其道故也. 紂刳比干, 囚箕子, 爲炮烙刑, 殺戮無時, 臣下懍然, 莫必其命.", "title": "其所以統之者非其道故也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 19, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 『漢書』 地理志, 沙羨縣屬江夏郡. 此地俱屬秦, 是有江南也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "楊倞注 : 巴在西南, 戎在西, 皆隷屬秦.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 47, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "楊倞注 : 謂東侵楚地, 所得者乃與齊爲界也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 61, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "楊倞注 : 『漢書』 地理志, 臨慮, 縣名, 屬河內, 今屬相州也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 84, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "楊倞注 : 圉, 當爲「圍」. 『漢書』「曹參下脩武, 度圍津」, 顔師古曰「在東郡」. 豈古名圍津, 轉寫爲「圉」? 或作「韋津」, 今有韋城, 豈是耶? 『史記』无忌謂魏 安釐王曰: 「秦固有懷·茅·邢丘, 城垝津以臨河內, 河內 共·汲必危.」 垝·圍聲相近, 疑同. 垝, 居委反.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 84, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 59, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0060_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "沙羨", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "江", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "漢書", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "地理志", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "沙羨縣", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "江夏郡", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "江", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "巴", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "戎", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "巴", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "戎", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楚", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楚", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "齊", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "韓", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "常山", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "臨慮", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "漢書", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "地理志", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "臨慮", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "河內", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "相州", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "魏", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "漢書", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "曹參", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "脩武", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "圍津", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "顔師古", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "東郡", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "圍津", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "韋津", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "韋城", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "史記", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "无忌", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "魏", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "安釐王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "懷", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "茅", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "邢丘", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "垝津", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "河內", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "河內", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "共", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "汲", "type": "지명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0060_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第十一 疆國篇 第十六 › 今秦南乃有沙羨與俱, 是乃江南也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0060_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 今秦南乃有沙羨與俱, 是乃江南也. 北與胡·貉爲鄰. 西有巴·戎. 東在楚者, 乃界於齊, 在韓者, 踰常山乃有臨慮, 在魏者, 乃據圉津, 卽去大梁百有二十里耳.", "title": "今秦南乃有沙羨與俱, 是乃江南也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 73, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 言惡者必稽考桀·紂, 以爲龜鏡也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 73, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 49, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0070_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "禹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "湯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "桀", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0070_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第十二 正論篇 第十八 › 親者疏之, 賢者賤之, 生民怨之.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0070_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 親者疏之, 賢者賤之, 生民怨之. 禹·湯之後也, 而不得一人之與. 刳比干, 囚箕子, 身死國亡, 爲天下之大僇. 後世之言惡者, 必稽焉.", "title": "親者疏之, 賢者賤之, 生民怨之.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 32, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注 : 儀, 謂風俗也. 諸夏迫近京師, 易一以敎化, 故同服同儀也.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 48, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "楊倞注 : 夷·狄遐遠, 又各在一方. 雖同爲要·荒之服, 其制度不同也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 48, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 36, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0070_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "蠻", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "夷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "戎", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "狄", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "夷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "狄", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0070_0020", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第十二 正論篇 第十八 › 土地形制不同者, 械用備飾不可不異也.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0070_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 土地形制不同者, 械用備飾不可不異也. 故諸夏之國同服同儀, 蠻·夷·戎·狄之國同服不同制.", "title": "土地形制不同者, 械用備飾不可不異也.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 20, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注：累, 讀爲縲, 『書』曰：釋箕子之囚.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 36, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "楊倞注：招麾, 指揮也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 36, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 23, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0080_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "書", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "呂尙", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "殷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0080_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第十八 成相篇 第二十五 › 世之衰, 讒人歸, 比干見刳箕子累.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0080_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 世之衰, 讒人歸, 比干見刳箕子累. 武王誅之, 呂尙麾, 殷民懷.", "title": "世之衰, 讒人歸, 比干見刳箕子累.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 36, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "楊倞注: 表, 築旌之. 言武王好善, 天下鄕之. 孔安國曰：商容, 殷之賢人. 紂所貶退也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 36, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0090_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "殷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "商容", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊倞", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孔安國", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "商容", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "殷", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0090_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第十九 大略篇 第二十七 › 武王始入殷, 表商容之閭, 釋箕子之囚,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0090_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 武王始入殷, 表商容之閭, 釋箕子之囚, 哭比干之墓, 天下鄕善矣!", "title": "武王始入殷, 表商容之閭, 釋箕子之囚,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 66, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 42, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_006_ko_006_0100_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "桀", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孔子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "匡", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "接輿", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "田常", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "闔閭", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_006_0100_0010", "locator": "荀子 › 『荀子』 卷第二十 堯問篇 第三十二 › 天地不知. 善桀·紂, 殺賢良.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_006_0100_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_006", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 天地不知. 善桀·紂, 殺賢良. 比干剖心, 孔子拘匡, 接輿避世, 箕子佯狂. 田常爲亂, 闔閭擅强. 爲惡得福, 善者有殃.", "title": "天地不知. 善桀·紂, 殺賢良.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
